# Generated resources / configs
# Runtime writes (settings, layouts, logs, crash dumps, profiles, captures) live
# under %APPDATA%\GSE and %LOCALAPPDATA%\GSE, so nothing lands in the tree.
# Misc survives only for the locomotion training artifacts listed below.
/resources
/Engine/Resources/Misc

# Per-project editor state (layout, captures, symbol cache, build outputs)
.gse/

# Generated cppreference hover index (bootstrap.py -> Editor/Tools/build_cppref_index.py)
/Editor/Resources/cppref.idx

# Locomotion training artifacts (runtime: live under Engine/Resources/Misc/; legacy: repo root)
/locomotion_checkpoint.bin
/locomotion_train_state.bin
/ref_walk.bin
/Engine/Resources/Misc/locomotion_checkpoint.bin
/Engine/Resources/Misc/locomotion_train_state.bin
